<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanshi" book-id="b-nanshi-049" chapter-id="c-nanshi-049-wangbi-huaizhen" source-id="s-nanshi-049-wangbi-huaizhen-ws12945115">
  <p id="c-nanshi-049-wangbi-huaizhen:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-049-wangbi-huaizhen:p001:m0000" ref="w3a_mm0_hw1_*A">劉懷珍</persName>字<persName id="c-nanshi-049-wangbi-huaizhen:p001:m0004" ref="w3a_mm0_hw1_*A">道玉</persName>，平原人，漢膠東康王<persName id="c-nanshi-049-wangbi-huaizhen:p001:m0016" ref="yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAM">寄</persName>之後也。</p>
  <p id="c-nanshi-049-wangbi-huaizhen:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">司空竟陵王<persName id="c-nanshi-049-wangbi-huaizhen:p002:m0005" ref="9d4_1cb_fb9">誕</persName>反，郡人<persName id="c-nanshi-049-wangbi-huaizhen:p002:m0010" ref="4ph_h3g_sr0">王弼</persName>門族甚盛，勸<persName id="c-nanshi-049-wangbi-huaizhen:p002:m0018" ref="w3a_mm0_hw1_*A">懷珍</persName>起兵助<persName id="c-nanshi-049-wangbi-huaizhen:p002:m0023" ref="9d4_1cb_fb9">誕</persName>，<persName id="c-nanshi-049-wangbi-huaizhen:p002:m0025" ref="w3a_mm0_hw1_*A">懷珍</persName>殺之。</p>
</text>
